===='''Cruisers'''====
Mexican cruisers were co-developed not long after the Second Mexican-American War with help from the [[Guardiola Foundation]] originally from stolen American designs. Zepeda-class cruisers were used primarily for long-range land, sea, and space strike capability, and were capable of light bombardment from orbit. The Zepeda-class was Mexico's only cruiser to enter service. At twice the length of the American Armstrong-Class it was considered the peak of its class of vessel. Of the five ships Mexico built, all five were destroyed during the Third Mexican War.

